are the other options used. We published ports.&nbsp;
So let's move those ports under the respective&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:25:51.690 --> 01:25:57.480
containers. So we create a property called ports&nbsp;
and list all the ports that you would like to&nbsp;&nbsp;

