Note that you could also specify the name of the&nbsp;
link this way without the semicolon and and the&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:26:19.410 --> 01:26:26.880
target target name, and it will create a link with&nbsp;
the same name as the target name. specifying the&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:26:26.880 --> 01:26:34.860
DB colon DB is similar to simply specifying dB,&nbsp;
we will assume the same value to create a link.&nbsp;&nbsp;

