01:29:16.820 --> 01:29:24.590
specify that in the version one of the Docker&nbsp;
compose file support for these came in version&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:29:24.590 --> 01:29:32.480
two. With version two and up, the format of the&nbsp;
file also changed a little bit. You no longer&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:29:32.479 --> 01:29:39.769
specify your stack information directly as you&nbsp;
did before. It is all encapsulated in Services&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:29:39.770 --> 01:29:46.160
section. So create a property called services&nbsp;
in the root of the file, and then move all the&nbsp;&nbsp;

